Error [E0112]: `takes` wants Float (an approximate binary number) for argument 1, but this is Decimal (an exact base-10 number)
  --> tests/ui/decimal_to_float_parameter.jet:7:11
    |
  7 |     takes(decimal)
    |           ^^^^^^^
 Why: Every argument must match its parameter's type
 Fix: Write the literal as Float{3.4}, or keep Decimal on both sides
